  "description": "One API over Fastboard — netless's ready-made UI for the Agora Interactive Whiteboard — for Android and iOS: join a room and get a board with a working toolbar rather than a bare canvas. Pulls in the platform binding that matches whichever target framework you build. Add Net.Agora.Fastboard.Maui in a .NET MAUI app to get the board as a MAUI view. For a bare canvas to build your own UI around, use Net.Agora.Whiteboard instead.",
